<title>ITALY: Alitalia ticket sales up 19.9pct Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Alitalia ticket sales up 19.9pct Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ticket sales at Italian national carrier Alitalia rose 19.9 percent in the first nine months of the year compared with 1995 levels, Alitalia director of sales Fausto Palombelli said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Palombelli announced the increase at a news conference called to present special Alitalia price offers on European routes for the autumn/winter season. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
